### EVENTHUB - ACCOUNTS API DOCUMENTATION
# VS Code REST Client (.http)
#
# Start server from the directory containing manage.py:
#     python manage.py runserver
#
# IMPORTANT:
# config/urls.py shows that accounts routes are included under:
#     api/accounts/
# Therefore every Accounts API URL below MUST use that prefix.
#
# Base URL:
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/accounts
#
# After each login, copy that response's access token into the matching
# variable below before running the corresponding protected profile request.
